  <h2>How to open the editor</h2>

  <p>
    Load your images into the <a href="https://kodinitools.com/bilderseriebearbeiten/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">image series editor</a>. Every image card in the gallery has a button with a magic wand icon (“Edit and Export”). Clicking it opens the editor for exactly that image. On the left you see the preview with its dimensions and estimated file size, on the right all tools stacked below each other, and at the top the undo and redo buttons.
  </p>

  <h2>Features at a glance</h2>

